        "title": "[2607.07395] When Prompts Ignore Structure: Graph-Based Attribute Reasoning for Calibrated VLMs",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.07395: When Prompts Ignore Structure: Graph-Based Attribute Reasoning for Calibrated VLMs",
        "keywords": null,
